cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "JSP-000674 / Erdős–Sárközy g_k(n): exact small values and verification record"
message: "If you use these artifacts, cite this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: firesh
    name: firesh
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-18"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/firesh/erdos817-subset-sum-progressions-audit"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible artifacts for JSP-000674 (Erdős Problem #817, the Erdős–Sárközy problem on
  arithmetic progressions in subset sums): exhaustive computations of the exact values
  g_3(1..5) = 1, 3, 8, 22, 60, exclusion of all witnesses up to N = 162 for n = 6 and
  N = 313 for n = 7, and the verification record for the negative answer to the
  "g_3(n) >> 3^n" question.
